    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1235090/extras/d125ab13bd43453cd5c8e097dd373003.avif?t=1587248383\" /></div><br><strong>Magical Miri</strong> is a <strong>2D side scroller platform video game in anime style</strong> and with a little <strong>fan service</strong>. It tells the story of Miri, a magic apprentice who is trying to prevent a possible war between dimensions. To achieve it, she must travel to 5 different kingdoms to beat the most powerful sorceresses and get their magic crystals that will grant her access to the Supreme Academy of Magic, where she\u2019ll find a big surprise.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1235090/extras/d8cffe1fe8f59c3590991005f6f16df1.avif?t=1587248383\" /></div><br><strong>Estudio Roxis</strong> is a company of two guys having fun creating video games.<br>As gamers and anime followers, we wanted to create a video game with an <strong>anime style, good gameplay, NES difficulty style level, fun to play, catchy soundtrack and endearing characters.</strong><br>Inspired by classics like <strong>Ghost 'n Goblins, Castlevania, and Mega Man</strong>, here is what we've achieved, <strong>we hope you enjoy playing it as we enjoyed creating it.</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1235090/extras/c893c7278c37bc86ce7e25909e827373.poster.avif?t=1587248383\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1235090/extras/c893c7278c37bc86ce7e25909e827373.webm?t=1587248383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div>\u2001\u2001\u2001<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1235090/extras/c893c7278c37bc86ce7e25909e827373.poster.avif?t=1587248383\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1235090/extras/c893c7278c37bc86ce7e25909e827373.webm?t=1587248383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div>\u2001\u2001\u2001<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1235090/extras/c893c7278c37bc86ce7e25909e827373.poster.avif?t=1587248383\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1235090/extras/c893c7278c37bc86ce7e25909e827373.webm?t=1587248383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Full controller support.<br></li><li>All original characters and art.<br></li><li>A powerful original sound track.<br></li><li>Non linear progression.<br></li><li>25+ different enemies.<br></li><li>5+ tough mini bosses to defeat.<br></li><li>5+ beautiful bosses to beat. ( \u0361\u00b0 \u035c\u0296 \u0361\u00b0)<br></li><li>Original vocal sounds.<br></li><li>Perks system.<br></li><li>Puzzle mini games.<br></li><li>Unlockable profiles.<br></li><li>Two endings.<br></li><li>Extremely fragile clothes.  ( \u0361\u00b0 \u035c\u0296 \u0361\u00b0)</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1235090/extras/3021588ee0ff9786f340a7dddf20d989.poster.avif?t=1587248383\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1235090/extras/3021588ee0ff9786f340a7dddf20d989.webm?t=1587248383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1235090/extras/3021588ee0ff9786f340a7dddf20d989.mp4?t=1587248383\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1235090/extras/7b8b6c453acad755f604638512054949.poster.avif?t=1587248383\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1235090/extras/7b8b6c453acad755f604638512054949.webm?t=1587248383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1235090/extras/7b8b6c453acad755f604638512054949.mp4?t=1587248383\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1235090/extras/b5c7f9c6f8db380c971207ff4350a5a3.poster.avif?t=1587248383\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1235090/extras/b5c7f9c6f8db380c971207ff4350a5a3.webm?t=1587248383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1235090/extras/b5c7f9c6f8db380c971207ff4350a5a3.mp4?t=1587248383\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1235090/extras/eec165db496cadfbec998db8d9c7795b.poster.avif?t=1587248383\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1235090/extras/eec165db496cadfbec998db8d9c7795b.webm?t=1587248383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1235090/extras/eec165db496cadfbec998db8d9c7795b.mp4?t=1587248383\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1235